       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.           TUNITCHK.
       AUTHOR.               MK MADDEN.
       DATE-WRITTEN.         MAY 30, 1985.
      *INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
      *D REMARKS.              THIS PROGRAM WILL READ THROUGH THE
      *D                       MATERIAL ACCUM MASTER DATA SET
      *D                       AND CALCULATE ONHAND UNITS FROM ACCOUNTING
      *D                       TOTALS AND FIND ALL THOSE THAT SHOW A
      *D                       DIFFERENCE FROM CSIS UNITS.
      *C
      *C   07MAR1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   JUNE 13, 1994   CR KALMAN     REQUEST# 6514
      *C     ADDED A TABLE AND ANOTHER SORT FILE TO HANDLE THE NEW
      *C     REPORT DESCRIBED IN REQUEST 93-011.  THIS CHANGE WAS
      *C     MADE ONLY ON THE AS/400.
      *C
      *C   06DEC1994   DAVE PLUM
      *C     CORRECTED A MINOR LOGIC PROBLEM WHICH ALLOWED THE PROGRAM
      *C     TO TRY AND ACCESS ENTRY NUMBER 101 OF A 100 ENTRY TABLE.
      *C
      *C   20DEC1994   DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED LOGIC TO PREVENT CODE "NON-STR" FROM BEING
      *C     PLACED ON THE 2ND REPORT (CONFLICTING ENDING BLANCES).
      *C
      *C   14FEB1995   CATHY ZUBEK
      *C     ADDED OPEN RECEIVER UNITS AND DOLLARS TO FORMULAS THAT
      *C     COMPUTE ENDING BALANCES.
      *C
      *C   09SEP1996   DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C   10FEB1997   DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED PROGRAM TO HANDLE AN 8 CHARACTER DATE FOR THE
      *C     DHOLDTRAN DATASET (MCFPCA0900).  THIS FILE WAS UNEXPECTEDLY
      *C     MODIFIED FOR THE J.01 RELEASE.  THIS CHANGE IS A J.01 FIX.
      *C     BASICALLY, WE ARE RECOMPILING THIS PROGRAM TO PICK UP A
      *C     PROPER RECORD LAYOUT FOR DHOLDTRAN FROM COPYLIB.
      *C
DP9803*C   20MAR1998  DAVE PLUM
DP9803*C     REVISED TO COMPUTE THE VALUE OF SORT-CSIS-UNITS USING THE
DP9803*C     BIN ONHAND QUANTITIES FOR BINS THAT ARE NOT OWNED BY A
DP9803*C     VENDOR.  THIS CHANGE IS NEEDED TO ACCOMMODATE THE OWNERSHIP
DP9803*C     BY BIN LOCATION CONCEPT WHICH WAS CREATED FOR USE IN
DP9803*C     DANVILLE FOR MATERIALS OWNED BY THE ISC.
DP9803*C
      *C   30MAR1998  JIM COFFMAN
      *C     CHANGED LOGIC TO INCLUDE TC333 IF IT IS A GOODYEAR-OWNED
      *C     PART WHEN CALULATING THE CSIS UNPROCESSED UNITS. OUTSOURCED
      *C     VENDOR ISSUES SHOULD NOT BE INCLUDED.
      *C
      *C   27APR1998  JIM COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED TC532 TO TRANSACTIONS CHECKED IN 300-PROCESS-DDAILYTCS
      *C     PARAGRAPH TO HANDLE BIN ADJUSTMENTS BETWEEN GOODYEAR AND ISC.
      *C
      *C   05OCT1998  JIM COFFMAN
      *C     BACKED OUT 532 CHECK AS 332'S ARE WRITTEN PAIRED WITH ALL 532'S
      *C     AND DANVILLE WAS GETTING A DOUBLE COUNT.
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN OF COPYLIB.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MMATL-ACCUM-MC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0601
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DDAILYTC-DT-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1601
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DHOLDTRAN-TD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0901
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MSTORERM-CD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

           SELECT SORT-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
9406CK     SELECT SORT-FILE2 ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  MMATL-ACCUM-MC-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MMATL-ACCUM-MC-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0600  OF MCFLCA0601.

       FD  DDAILYTC-DT-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DDAILYTC-DT-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1600  OF MCFLCS1601.

       FD  DHOLDTRAN-TD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DHOLDTRAN-TD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0900  OF MCFLCA0901.

       FD  MSTORERM-CD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-CD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.

      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*

       FD  ONLINE-PRT
           DATA RECORD IS PRT-REC
           RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.

       01  PRT-REC                       PIC X(133).

       SD  SORT-FILE
           DATA RECORD IS SORT-REC
           RECORD CONTAINS 68  CHARACTERS.

       01  SORT-REC.
           05  SORT-CLASS               PIC X(4).
           05  SORT-STORES-CODE         PIC X(8).
           05  SORT-ACCTG-UNITS-PD      PIC S9(10).
           05  SORT-ACCTG-UNITS-OPEN    PIC S9(10).
           05  SORT-DDAILYTC-UNITS  REDEFINES
               SORT-ACCTG-UNITS-OPEN    PIC S9(10).
           05  SORT-CSIS-UNITS          PIC S9(10).
           05  SORT-UNIT-MEASURE        PIC XX.
           05  SORT-ACT-DATE.
               10 SORT-ACT-DATE-CC      PIC X(2).
               10 SORT-ACT-DATE-YYMMDD  PIC X(6).
           05  SORT-RECORD-TYPE         PIC X.
           05  SORT-STD-COST            PIC S9(11)V9(4).

9406CK SD  SORT-FILE2
  .        DATA RECORD IS SORT-REC2
  .        RECORD CONTAINS 36  CHARACTERS.
  .
  .    01  SORT-REC2.
  .        05  SORT2-CLASS               PIC X(4).
  .        05  SORT2-STORES-CODE         PIC X(8).
  .        05  SORT2-END-UNITS           PIC S9(10).
9406CK     05  SORT2-END-DOLLARS         PIC S9(12)V99.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       77  NO-MORE-SORT                 PIC XXX     VALUE SPACES.
       77  LINE-CNT                     PIC 99     VALUE 0.
       77  PAGE-CNT                     PIC 9(4)    VALUE 0.
       77  TOTAL-UNITS                  PIC S9(10)  VALUE 0.
       77  TOTAL-DOLLARS                PIC S9(12)V99  VALUE 0.
9406CK 77  END-UNITS-BALANCE            PIC S9(10).
  .    77  END-DOLLARS-BALANCE          PIC S9(12)V99.
  .    77  TBL-IX                       PIC 999 COMP VALUE ZEROS.
  .    77  EOF-SORTFILE2                PIC X.
  .    77  END-OF-TABLE                 PIC X.
  .    77  BAD-BALANCES-FOUND           PIC X.
9406CK 77  TABLE-FILLED                 PIC X.
       77  TC-QUALIFIES-SW              PIC X       VALUE SPACES.
       77  SAVE-CORP-CODE               PIC X(8)    VALUE SPACES.
       77  SAVE-ACCTG-UNITS-PD          PIC S9(10) VALUE ZEROS.
       77  SAVE-ACCTG-UNITS-OPEN        PIC S9(10) VALUE ZEROS.
       77  SAVE-CSIS-UNITS              PIC S9(10) VALUE ZEROS.
       77  SAVE-STD-COST                PIC S9(11)V9(4) VALUE ZEROS.
       77  CSIS-DDAILYTC-QTY            PIC S9(10) VALUE ZEROS.
       77  SAVE-DIFF-UNITS              PIC S9(10) VALUE ZEROS.
       77  ENTRY-FROM-CSAS              PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
       77  CODES-IN-ERROR               PIC S9(5) BINARY VALUE ZEROS.
       77  MCXCBLERR-SCOPE              PIC X(1)   VALUE "C".
DP9803 77  SUB                          PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE ZEROS.

       COPY SOPNRAV IN COPYLIB.

      ************************************************************
      **     REPORT PRINT LINES                                 **
      ************************************************************

9406CK*--------------- PRINT LINES FOR REPORT 1 -----------------------

       01  HEADER1.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(19)
               VALUE "TUNITCHK".
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(42)
               VALUE "CORPORATE STORES ACCOUNTING SYSTEM".
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(5)   VALUE "DATE ".
           05  DATE-H1                    PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(6)   VALUE SPACES.

       01  HEADER2.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(6)   VALUE "PAGE".
           05  PAGE-H2                    PIC ZZZ9   VALUE ZERO.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(06)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(45)
               VALUE "DIFFERENCE IN ACCOUNTING AND CSIS UNITS".
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(5)   VALUE "TIME ".
           05  TIME-H2                    PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.

       01  HEADER3.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(25)
               VALUE "ACCOUNTING     ACCOUNTING".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(15) VALUE "           CSIS".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(11) VALUE "TOTAL ACCTG".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(33) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(14) VALUE "LAST STOREROOM".

       01  HEADER4.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(35)
               VALUE "MATERIAL CODE  UM  (UNITS PAID  +  ".
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(40)
               VALUE "UNITS OPEN  +  UNPROCESSED UNITS)  =    ".
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(27)
               VALUE "UNITS         CSIS UNITS   ".
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(31)
               VALUE "DIFFERENCE    ACTIVITY DATE    ".

       01  DETAIL-LINE.
           05  PRT-CLASS                  PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-HYPHEN                 PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-MATLCODE               PIC X(7)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(4)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-UM                     PIC XX     VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-ACCTG-UNITS-PD         PIC Z(9)9-.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(4)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-ACCTG-UNITS-OPEN       PIC Z(9)9-.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(9)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-DDAILYTC-UNITS         PIC Z(9)9-.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(7)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-ACCTG-UNITS-TOTAL      PIC Z(9)9-.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(5)    VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-CSIS-UNITS             PIC Z(9)9-.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(2)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-DIFF-UNITS             PIC Z(9)9-.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(5)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-ACT-DATE               PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.

       01  DETAIL-LINE-2.
           05  PRT-CLASS-2                PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-HYPHEN-2               PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-MATLCODE-2             PIC X(7)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(4)  VALUE "*** ".
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(21)
                       VALUE "NO STANDARD COST HAS ".
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(22)
                       VALUE "BEEN ASSIGNED TO THIS ".
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(12)
                       VALUE "RAW MATERIAL".
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(4)  VALUE " ***".

       01  NO-CODES-MSG.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(28)
               VALUE "  ***** NO CODES WERE FOUND ".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(32)
               VALUE "WITH DIFFERENT ONHAND VALUES IN ".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(19)
               VALUE "CSAS AND CSIS *****".

       01  TOTAL-CODES-MSG.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(8)  VALUE "  ***** ".
           05  PRT-CODE-COUNT  PIC ZZZZ9.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(15) VALUE " CODE(S) FOUND ".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(32)
               VALUE "WITH DIFFERENT ONHAND VALUES IN ".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(19)
               VALUE "CSAS AND CSIS *****".

